This is the application at this phase you will be able to login (if no data found it will return error)

and ask you to register.

you register and login you will see home page

click on add issue and fill the form and on home page table you will see the data

click on the id link to delete the entry and will be back on the homepage will all the result


to run you can npm install and then node initdb.js

and once done ...run node app.ctrl.js


